[E0417] Error: a range of elements must be borrowed
    ╭─[ err/202_ranges_walked/main.wip:14:16 ]
    │
 14 │     val part = a[0..2]
    │                ───┬───
    │                   ╰───── a range of elements
    │
    │ Help: borrow it
